    "title": "Get Pi Day food deals from 7-Eleven, Burger King, Blaze and more",
    "text": "March 14, 2026, 4:26 a.m. ETRestaurants and convenience stores across the United States are celebrating Pi Day on March 14 with limited-time deals centered on the mathematical constant commonly rounded to 3.14.The annual observance plays on the similarity between the word “pi” and “pie,” prompting restaurants to offer discounted pizzas, desserts and other treats priced at $3.14.Several national chains are offering promotions tied to the date.7-Eleven Pi Day dealAt 7-Eleven, rewards members can purchase any whole pizza for $3.14. The promotion begins March 13 and runs through March 14.Blaze Pizza Pi Day dealParticipating locations of Blaze Pizza are offering customers a buy-one, get-one deal on 11-inch pizzas, with the second pizza priced at $3.14.Voodoo Doughnut Pi Day dealMembers of the fan club at Voodoo Doughnut can get two Banana Cream Pie doughnuts for $3.14 as part of the promotion.BJ’s Restaurants and Brewhouse Pi Day dealAt BJ’s Restaurants and Brewhouse, customers can receive a full-size classic Pizookie, the chain’s signature cookie dessert baked in a pizza-style pan for $3.14 when they purchase a large or shareable pizza. The deal is available for dine-in and takeout on March 14.Burger King Pi Day dealBurger King is also marking the day with a dessert promotion. Customers who spend $3.14 or more on March 14 can receive a free Hershey’s Pie or Cinnamon Apple Pie.",
